@baseUrl = http://localhost:5128
@HostAddress = {{baseUrl}}
@companyAdminEmail = admin@al-salamah.com
@companyAdminPassword = User@123456
@deputyAdminEmail = deputy@al-salamah.com
@deputyAdminPassword = User@123456

### =====================================================================
### 12. SMART INTAKE, TRIAGE DESK & ROLE-SHAPED JOB VIEWS (FR-WKF-02/03/04/05, FR-NOT-01)
### =====================================================================
### The service transaction lifecycle: a request is opened as a draft, filled against the step's
### dynamic form, submitted (which issues AMX-YYYY-NNNNN and starts the SLA clock), then accepted or
### rejected at the management triage desk. Staff see a job through turn-based visibility; clients
### see their own requests through the client projection.
###
### The full lifecycle and the client-vs-staff isolation are covered exhaustively by the live
### end-to-end suites (IntakeLifecycleTests + the scripted run over six real accounts). This .http
### suite is a smoke test of the surface with explicit assertions. Field casing is camelCase (D-8).

### 12.1 Company Admin login
# @name companyAdminLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "email": "{{companyAdminEmail}}", "password": "{{companyAdminPassword}}" }

?? status == 200

@companyAdminToken = {{companyAdminLogin.data.token}}

### 12.2 A default template exists for the Licensing category (needed to open a draft)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-templates?serviceCategory=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 12.3 Staff open a draft without naming a client -> 400
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/intake
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "serviceCategory": 1 }

?? status == 400

### 12.4 Submitting a non-existent request -> 404
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/intake/3f9a1c22-7b44-4e18-9d05-6c2e8a5f1b70/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 404

### 12.5 Uploading to a non-existent request -> 404
### A real file is attached: without one, binding refuses the request (400, "file is required")
### before the request is ever looked up, and the test would be checking the wrong thing.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/intake/3f9a1c22-7b44-4e18-9d05-6c2e8a5f1b70/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AmanixUploadBoundary

--AmanixUploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="site-plan.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4
%%EOF
--AmanixUploadBoundary--

?? status == 404

### 12.5b Uploading with no file at all -> 400, in the standard ApiResponse envelope
### Binding failures used to answer in ASP.NET's ProblemDetails shape; they now use the same
### envelope as every other error, so a client needs one error parser, not two.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/intake/3f9a1c22-7b44-4e18-9d05-6c2e8a5f1b70/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 400
?? body isSuccess == false

### 12.6 Staff list of jobs (staff view) -> 200
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-instances?pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 12.7 The triage desk queue -> 200
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-instances?awaitingTriage=true&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 200

### 12.8 A non-existent job in the staff view -> 404
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-instances/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 404

### 12.9 CompanyAdmin is not a Client, so the client portal refuses them -> 403
### ClientRequests.View is granted to the Client role only; a staff member holding
### WorkflowInstances.View still cannot reach /my-requests.
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/my-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Accept-Language: en

?? status == 403

### 12.10 Unauthenticated access to the intake surface -> 401
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/intake
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "serviceCategory": 1 }

?? status == 401
